    "make_it":  [
                    "Husk and quarter the tomatillos, then lay them in the crock with the chicken thighs.",
                    "Add the chopped onion, both cans of green chiles, the chopped poblano peppers, the jalapeno, the garlic, the ground cumin, the dried oregano, the chicken broth, and a good pinch of salt and pepper.",
